# Pull request descriptions

Match the pull requests already in the repo:

- Title: `vX.Y.Z - Feature, feature, and feature`
- Body: `## Summary` and one bullet per changelog item

`.github/workflows/pr-summary.yml` writes this from `CHANGELOG.md` when a pull request opens. Later pushes refresh it while `<!-- lux-pr-summary -->` is in the description. Delete that comment to keep a hand-edited description.

Do not add Intent, What Changed, Risk Assessment, Pipeline, Testing, screenshots, or command logs.
